0/000110465924092245/0001104659-24-092245-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2023-07-25","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000080724923000090/0000807249-23-000090-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2023-07-20","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465923082463/0001104659-23-082463-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Atlanta Braves Holdings, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Amusement & Recreation Services\", based in GA, and has been publicly reporting for 2 years.","It reported $743.2m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 52.5% against the same quarter a year earlier.","Listed on Nasdaq, Nasdaq, OTC, it funds itself from operations ($333.9m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 52.5% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $72.0m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $333.9m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (1.7% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-57.3% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"},{"text":"Debt of $709.2m against equity of $519.0m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000110465926058558/0001104659-26-058558-index.htm","accession":"0001104659-26-058558"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 3.8% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (140,398 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1958140/000080724926000022/0000807249-26-000022-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 26.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.26,"consecutive":2,"current":0.525,"current_display":"52.5%","threshold_display":"26.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":0.017,"current_display":"1.7%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rati